  "street_name": "BELLAMY DRIVE",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The total depth of the enlarged part of the dwellinghouse\r\nbeyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse as stated on the submitted application\r\nform is inconsistent with the submitted drawings. The submission therefore\r\nfails to comply with condition A.4(2)(a)(i)&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;of development permitted by Class A.1(g) to Part 1 (of Schedule 2) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The total enlargement, including the proposed ground floor rear extension, by reason of its connection to an existing rear outbuilding, would extend beyond the original rear wall by more than 6 metres. The proposal therefore does not comply with limitation A.1(g)(i) and A.1(ja) to Class A of Part 1 (of Schedule 2) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
